                <mxCell id="p1-onstart" value="&lt;b&gt;Strategy.on_start()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. cache.instrument(...)  →  si None: log.error + stop()&lt;br&gt;2. subscribe_bars(bar_type)&lt;br&gt;3. crear audit/audit_&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;_&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;.csv&lt;br&gt;4. clock.set_timer(heartbeat, 30 s)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;spacingLeft=10" parent="1" vertex="1">
